{"answers":[{"question_id":"region_a:q1","answer":"Harrow is not a computing provider on the supplied facts. B-RAA 2 defines a computing provider as a person that provides storage, hosting or computing services in Region B, or a Region B-incorporated person providing those services elsewhere. Harrow is described as a specialist clinic retaining the referral in its own clinical record for its own care, not as a provider of storage, hosting or computing services to another person. Its own clinical referral portal therefore does not, on these facts, bring it within that definition.

The B-RAA production-order framework consequently does not apply to Harrow's own clinical records as described. Section 3 permits the Records Access Commissioner to order a computing provider to produce records stored by or accessible to that provider, but only for national security or the investigation of serious crime. No computing-provider status, qualifying purpose or order is present here. Section 4's non-disclosure power is only a consequence of an order under Section 3 and is likewise not engaged.

No other Region B provision read in this assessment gives a public authority power to require Harrow to disclose or provide access to these records. The Health Records Act provisions are also not engaged because Harrow is not a covered provider, service agent or data host. Accordingly, no applicable Region B law or practice identified in this corpus would prevent Harrow from complying with approved transfer clauses for this referral. This conclusion is limited to the supplied facts and the Region B provisions; it does not rule out a future Section 3 order if Harrow's status or the purpose of an investigation were different.","facts":[{"fact_id":"f_c345501e8bd4","path":"","quote":""},{"fact_id":"f_3707d0e0f8a9","path":"","quote":""},{"fact_id":"f_febc895bce9e","path":"","quote":""},{"fact_id":"f_8c44c6e413c5","path":"","quote":""},{"fact_id":"f_c042b1fad3c8","path":"","quote":""}],"citations":["B-RAA 2","B-RAA 3","B-RAA 4","B-HRA 2","B-HRA 3"],"quote_id":"B-RAA 3#L1","requirement_ids":["records_access_act_scope","health_records_act_scope"]}],"requirements":[]}

